# Graph generation (opt-in only)

Do **not** generate graph, chart, plot, or diagram images by default.

- Never call image-generation tools (e.g. GenerateImage) for graphs/charts unless the user explicitly asks for a graph, chart, plot, or diagram.
- Never invent or proactively offer graph images in reports, analyses, or summaries.
- Text, tables, and Mermaid (when useful for structure) are fine without a graph request; raster/PNG graph images are not.
- Phrases that count as an explicit request: "graph", "chart", "plot", "diagram", "visualize", "draw a graph", or similar.
- If the user did not ask for a graph, answer with text/tables only — no graph image.
